                    "Take the first step today and schedule your wellness visit!",
                    "When you choose to get your plan materials online, you have safe and easy access to your documents 24/7. Instead of waiting for us to mail you documents like your Explanation of Benefits (EOBs), we will send you an email or text message with a link to see your documents via your computer, smartphone, or tablet. (You'll need to log in to your UPMC Health Plan digital account to see your documents.)",
