                    "Access to an interactive website that contains professional and personal development resources.",
                    "TAHS is your personalized health and well-being program that’s designed to motivate and support you in making healthy lifestyle choices.",
                    "UPMC Health Plan offers customized help with lifestyle and condition management, as well as shared decision support services. These health and wellness services are personalized to help you meet your goals. And they're free for all UPMC Health Plan members! Our health coaches can work with you to achieve your health-related goals. They will help you stay motivated and keep you accountable.",
                    "Members of the team hold professional degrees and licenses as registered nurses, counselors, diabetes educators, dietitians, social workers, exercise physiologists, and health education specialists. With lifestyle management health coaching, you can work with our experts one-on-one or in a group to set goals for healthy living. Coaches will help you lower your risk for chronic conditions and manage conditions you already have. Health coaches will also work with you to personalize your experience and focus on goals and strategies that work best for you.\r\n\r\nProgram areas include:\r\nWeight management.\r\nPhysical Activity.\r\nTobacco cessation.\r\nStress management.\r\nNutrition basics.\r\nDiabetes prevention.\r\nHealthy families.\r\nSleep.",
                    "Lifestyle management is available to people of all ages, typically with a parent/guardian for under age 14. You can get help by phone, or virtually.",
                    "Condition management involves receiving education and support from our expert care managers. They provide tools to help you understand your health, manage a new or chronic condition, and learn ways to partner with your providers. Condition management topics:\r\nDiabetes.\r\nCardiovascular health.\r\nRespiratory health.\r\nBehavioral health.\r\nChronic pain.\r\n\r\nPodcast: What is a care manager, and how can they help me?\r\nMandi Batykefer, care manager for the Commercial-dedicated team at UPMC Health Plan, tells us who the care managers are at UPMC Health Plan and what they do to support members.\r\n\"Health Break:\" What is a care manager and how can they help me? | UPMC MyHealth Matters\r\n\r\nAdditional care management programs include:\r\nThe Baby Steps maternity health coaching program.\r\nPediatric care management.\r\nCase management.",
                    "Shared decision making allows you and your health care provider to discuss your treatment options. Understanding your care goals while taking your values into consideration is important when it comes to:\r\nOptional surgeries such as hip, knee, or bariatric surgery.\r\nCondition or pain management.\r\nCancer treatment.",
                    "For a virtual visit, select Video Visit under the care tab. To start by phone, call 1-844-822-3367 (TTY: 711). Help is available Monday through Friday from 8 a.m. to 7 p.m. and Saturday from 8 a.m.to 3 p.m.",
                    "Program areas include:\r\nWeight management.\r\nPhysical Activity.\r\nTobacco cessation.\r\nStress management.\r\nNutrition basics.\r\nDiabetes prevention.\r\nHealthy families.\r\nSleep.",
