                    "Get on-the-go access to your health insurance information, benefits, and tools with the UPMC Health Plan app. For added convenience, you can use your UPMC Health Plan Login to access the app.\r\n\r\nWith the app, you can:",
                    "Find care, search for participating providers, select your primary care provider, and call a nurse with the UPMC MyHealth 24/7 Nurse Line.",
                    "Access 24/7 video visits to get the virtual care you and your family need for nonemergency conditions.",
                   
                   
                    "PCPs offer many no-cost services - including preventive screenings - that can help you get or stay healthy. They are also responsible for coordinating their patients' care with other healthcare providers.",
                    "Check out UPMC Health Plan's \"Health Break\" podcast to learn more about why it's important to have a PCP.",
                    "Personal care plan\r\n$0 annual well-visits for adults and children\r\n$0 preventive screenings\r\n$0 flu shot\r\nCoordinate your care when you are seeing multiple providers\r\nReferrals to $0 health coaching for lifestyle changes or chronic condition management\r\nReferrals to other participating providers or specialists",
                    "Searching for health care providers is easy with our online Find Care tool. It has a number of helpful filters, including:\r\nVirtual primary care practices.\r\nOffers virtual visits.\r\nAccepting new patients.",
